  "_source": "Worked out by hand from the rule the server enforces (trigger private.check_trade_timeline): add the buys and subtract the sells of one holding day by day, in date order; the holding is oversold if the running total is below zero at the end of any day. Buys of a day count before the sells of that same day, whatever the order of the list. Quantities are exact decimals (up to 8 decimal places), never floating point. Used by Position.isOversold on iOS and Android.",
